<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43073" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑταιρ-εῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑταιρ-ήϊος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑταίρειος</span> Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			1.137
		</span></i>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or
				<i>belonging to companions :</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς ἑ.</span>”
				<i>presiding over fellowship,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.44
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Diph.
				20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				1.39
			</span></i>, etc.; so, of God, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.452
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόνος ἑ.</span> the murder
				<i>of a comrade,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.519
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Alc.
			</span></i> Mess.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>amorous,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. φιλότης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					58
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.415
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Antiphil.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑταιρεῖον, τό,</span>
			<i>house of a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑταίρα,</span> Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				873
			</span></i>.</div>
